# Only what the API image builds from goes to Docker (apps/api/Dockerfile).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/.expo
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.claude
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
